WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.867 --> 00:00:20.495
At last it was the Little Mermaid's fifteenth birthday.

2
00:00:20.496 --> 00:00:27.150
"Today will be your first day in the Upper World," announced her grandmother.

3
00:00:27.151 --> 00:00:31.687
"I'm so excited!" squealed the Little Mermaid.

4
00:00:31.688 --> 00:00:36.002
"I've been waiting so long for this day."

5
00:00:36.003 --> 00:00:42.153
The Wise Mermaid placed a wreath of white lilies in the Little Mermaid's hair.

6
00:00:42.154 --> 00:00:47.921
Then she hooked four oysters on her tail, a sign of royalty.

7
00:00:47.922 --> 00:00:52.419
"Ouch! That hurts!" cried the Little Mermaid.

8
00:00:52.420 --> 00:00:59.522
"A small sacrifice for becoming a 15-year-old princess," said her grandmother.

9
00:00:59.523 --> 00:01:04.216
The Little Mermaid had to agree the oysters looked lovely.

10
00:01:04.217 --> 00:01:08.233
But she was anxious to start her adventure.

11
00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:12.290
"Please hurry, Grandmother," she begged.

12
00:01:12.291 --> 00:01:15.538
"Go ahead, dear," her grandmother said.

13
00:01:15.539 --> 00:01:18.407
"But don't stay too long.

14
00:01:18.408 --> 00:01:23.678
Remember, your place is here, under the sea."

15
00:01:23.679 --> 00:01:29.860
Impatiently the Little Mermaid hugged her grandmother good-bye and swam away.

16
00:01:29.861 --> 00:01:35.049
When the Little Mermaid got to the surface, the sun was just setting.

17
00:01:35.050 --> 00:01:39.102
She saw the sky turn from blue to pink.

18
00:01:39.103 --> 00:01:45.770
As night fell, the sky turned deep purple and sparkled with stars.

19
00:01:45.771 --> 00:01:50.336
Soon the moon poured light on the sea.

20
00:01:50.337 --> 00:01:55.916
"It's so beautiful in the Upper World!" exclaimed the Little Mermaid.

21
00:01:55.917 --> 00:02:01.822
In the distance the mermaid saw a ship with three tall masts.

22
00:02:01.823 --> 00:02:07.588
She swam closer and saw that the ship was standing still in the water.

23
00:02:07.589 --> 00:02:12.800
Music was playing, and she saw bright, colored lights.

24
00:02:12.801 --> 00:02:16.848
Sailors moved about on the ship's top deck.

25
00:02:16.849 --> 00:02:20.210
They walked on two legs.

26
00:02:20.211 --> 00:02:25.327
"Humans?" she wondered. "What a strange sight."

27
00:02:25.328 --> 00:02:31.147
Excited, she swam right up to the side of the ship and peeked through a window.

28
00:02:31.148 --> 00:02:35.157
Inside, more humans were singing and dancing.

29
00:02:35.158 --> 00:02:39.059
All of them were dressed in fine clothes.

30
00:02:39.060 --> 00:02:42.487
"It looks like a party!" she thought.

31
00:02:42.488 --> 00:02:49.179
The mermaid studied each human carefully until her eyes fell upon a young man.

32
00:02:49.180 --> 00:02:53.916
"Oh, how handsome," she thought.

33
00:02:53.917 --> 00:02:58.985
Her eyes followed him as everyone went up on deck.

34
00:02:58.986 --> 00:03:04.398
"We remember when you were born, dear Prince, 16 years ago,"

35
00:03:04.399 --> 00:03:07.912
said a woman with a blue feather in her hair.

36
00:03:07.913 --> 00:03:11.758
"He's a prince!" exclaimed the Little Mermaid.

37
00:03:11.759 --> 00:03:18.894
Another guest said, "With your kind heart, you'll be a great king some day!"

38
00:03:18.895 --> 00:03:21.886
"May every year be as happy as this one!"

39
00:03:21.887 --> 00:03:24.979
added a man, holding up his glass.

40
00:03:24.980 --> 00:03:30.400
"Happy Birthday, Prince!" the crowd cheered.

41
00:03:30.401 --> 00:03:34.607
"Everyone loves him," thought the Little Mermaid.

42
00:03:34.608 --> 00:03:37.636
"He must be wonderful."

43
00:03:37.637 --> 00:03:43.686
Rockets shot into the air and exploded into a thousand tiny lights.

44
00:03:43.687 --> 00:03:49.419
The water reflected the fireworks, and the entire ocean glowed.

45
00:03:49.420 --> 00:03:54.151
"Oh my!" The mermaid had never seen such a sight.

46
00:03:54.152 --> 00:03:57.965
Frightened, she quickly dived underwater.

47
00:03:57.966 --> 00:04:03.023
But looking up through the water, she soon lost her fear.

48
00:04:03.024 --> 00:04:08.525
"So many sparkling flowers in the sky!" she exclaimed.

49
00:04:08.526 --> 00:04:13.009
The Prince hugged his guests, shook their hands, and said,

50
00:04:13.010 --> 00:04:16.269
"Thank you for a lovely celebration."

51
00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:20.507
The Little Mermaid swam up to the surface and watched.

52
00:04:20.508 --> 00:04:24.742
The Prince was the most beautiful of all the humans.

53
00:04:24.743 --> 00:04:28.436
He was as beautiful as the statue in her garden.

54
00:04:28.437 --> 00:04:33.463
But soon the music stopped, and the colored lights were put away.

55
00:04:33.464 --> 00:04:37.746
"Thanks for all your help!" said the Prince to his crew.

56
00:04:37.747 --> 00:04:40.215
"It was a great party."

57
00:04:40.216 --> 00:04:44.583
Then the Prince and his guests went below the deck to sleep.

58
00:04:44.584 --> 00:04:50.104
But the Little Mermaid could not swim away from the ship or the handsome Prince.

59
00:04:50.105 --> 00:04:57.256
For her it was love at first sight!
